h your friends!\nEndless Mode & Achivements coming soon.\n", "short_description": "Encourage your friends to take the up  the challenge and play GeoGet! It doesn\u2019t matter if you\u2019re a beginner, globetrotter or explorer - check your knowledge about world geography. Use your head, spin the globe and mark the correct countries. \nLerning geography was never this immersive and easy!\n\nThree difficulty levels available! \nHot goggles mode to play along with your friends!\nEndless Mode & Achivements coming soon."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://evilport.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://evilport.com/", "publisher_name": "Evilport", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://evilport.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ARCADE", "EDUCATIONAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "241551778158700"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331159_272239849860466_4057311611457634304_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T9iIJQ4oDQoQ7kNvwEM2DTa&_nc_oc=Adq9uQEHyCxIrSs3m_prYxjdg1m0ax3JoDn-X-tV1rqCFL9vDPz5b_vUljGUKtiADKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD9PA2MbUGcLnGNjobnHUWfVku5o-0_o7roB5V1C_tWCQ&oe=6A5CCAD1"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "GeoGet", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 146